OL,3,GNEWSAMan in critical condition after
OL,4,Ahouse explosion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man is fighting for his life in
OL,7,Fhospital following a house explosion in
OL,8,FManchester.
OL,10,FFire crews and police remain at the
OL,11,Fscene on Ash Street in Harpurhey,
OL,12,Ffollowing a blast at about 10:20 BST.
OL,14,FGreater Manchester Police said the man
OL,15,Fwas in a critical condition and had
OL,16,Fbeen taken to hospital.
OL,18,FNeighbouring properties are being
OL,19,Fevacuated, and a woman has been treated
OL,20,Ffor what police said were believed to
OL,21,Fbe minor injuries.
